# Generated result artifacts land here.
#
# Nothing in this directory is committed. Every file is produced by:
#     python run_all.py
#
# Expected contents after a successful run:
#   metrics.json                     all measured values + validation verdict
#   metrics_headline.csv             long format (model, metric, value)
#   comparison_table.csv             baseline vs graph-aware, with differences
#   alerts.csv / alerts.json         explained alerts
#   resources.csv                    per-run CPU/RAM/runtime/throughput
#   feature_importance.csv
#   leakage_audit.json
#   knowledge_graph_subgraph.json
#   predictions/test_predictions.npz raw predictions for independent verification
#   reports/results_for_paper.md     filled paper template
#   reports/comparison_table.md
#   reports/resource_evaluation.md
#
# If a stage fails, metrics.json records status=partial/failed and the values for
# that stage are null. No file here contains an estimate presented as a measurement.
